Lastly, our network security architecture follows zero-trust, micro-segmentation, and defence-in-depth patterns, with Intrusion Detection/Prevention Systems (IDS/IPS) deployed. We also conduct annual penetration testing plus post-major release testing, with the last test showing 2 medium findings that were all remediated, demonstrating our commitment to maintaining a secure environment.

